fuel measure, ordered two children and newly calibrated enumeration combine. -/
def graph (n : Nat) : Program 3 := ExchangeGraphRecursion.graph
  LogicLineages.OrdinalComparison.TerminationOrdering.ID1Completion.SourceComputabilityCompletion.Continuation20261117.MinimalOriginalPrimaryTypedCarrier.AST.OriginalEnumerationRecursionInterface.R LogicLineages.OrdinalComparison.TerminationOrdering.ID1Completion.SourceComputabilityCompletion.Continuation20261117.MinimalOriginalPrimaryTypedCarrier.AST.OriginalEnumerationRecursionInterface.D (LogicLineages.OrdinalComparison.TerminationOrdering.ID1Completion.SourceComputabilityCompletion.Continuation20261117.MinimalOriginalPrimaryTypedCarrier.AST.OriginalEnumerationRecursionInterface.G n)
